These files are swift IQ3_S.
Plan for 'IQ3_S 128K':
  model     Swift 1.5 IQ3_S, 84 GB   (your files in /dev/shm/sc117/IQ3_S)
  context   128K    pictures on (the reader runs on the graphics card)    parallel fit to your card
  download  About 6.1 GB to download: the draft layer (5.2 GB) and the picture reader (0.9 GB). Your model files are used where they are. To skip the picture reader (the model then answers text only), add --vision off; or put its mmproj file next to your model files. To skip the draft layer (a little slower, less memory), add --mtp off. The engine for your graphics card is downloaded first (from the update source; its size is shown when it starts).
  drafting  MTP
  tuning    skip    access This computer only, port 8080
  same as   strata launch --model-path "/dev/shm/sc117/IQ3_S" --model iq3_s --family swift --data-dir "/marimo/llm/sc117-data" --context 128k --vision gpu --tune skip --access local --port 8080
